  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB Reform and Growth Monitor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the WB Reform and Growth Monitor is to enable civil society organisations (CSOs) in the Western Balkans (WB) to actively contribute to the design and credible implementation of reforms related to the four pillars of the Growth Plan for the WB (Growth Plan). The proposed action aims at four specific objectives which systematically provide for evidence based monitoring, CSO led policy dialogue with a multiplication factor through an extensive capacity building grant scheme and implementation of communication strategy on progress of the countries and benefits of the plan.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
